* Use adjustment factor from the daily file;
* This step is useful or even necessary when two datasets (daily and monthly files) are downloaded from different time;

* If researchers to scale an analyst forecast by the adjusted price, the adjustment factor for the analyst forecast 
* (which comes from the daily file) should match the adjustment factor of the price.
* In other words, they should adjust the number to the same date (typically the data download date if the dataset is updated daily);

